* ======================================================================
*
* LEN parameters are derived by analogy to CGenFF forcefield for small 
* molecules
* And parameters for GS-CA1, amino acid peptide and Trifluoromethane
* Initial guess of parameters were derived from analogy to GS-CA1
* Then optimized from QM calculations (DFT at B3LYP/6-31G* level of theory 
* with implicit solvent) by splitting the molecule into fragments
* fragment 1 was reparameterized from CGenFF and them merged in the 
* current parameters
* Impropers were added on aromatic rings to ensure planarity of the 
* molecule
* MM dihedral PES to the QM has an RMSE of 4.4 kcal/mol - Juan Rey
* Atom names follow the convention of QNG to match molecular structures 
* from the RCSB
* Comments next to a parameter specify its source fragment
*
* Toppar stream file generated by
* CHARMM General Force Field (CGenFF) program version 2.5
* For use with CGenFF version 4.6
*

